--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -3,6 +3,10 @@
 All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
 
 ## Unreleased
+
+- Fix: Keep Elementor fragment caching bypassed throughout native preview requests, including nested templates that change the current post.
+
+- Improve: Elementor Fragment Cache now has a default-OFF global switch, shared safe frontend fragments for authenticated visitors, and a protected admin-bar site purge. Preserve widget opt-ins when OFF, hide their editor panel, and determine update protection directly from the global switch without scanning saved documents.
 
 - Improve: Centralize Elementor/Pro compatibility declarations and show accepted combinations separately from tested evidence.
 - Tweak: Atomic Interactions compatibility accepts the documented Elementor 4.3.2 / Pro 4.3.0 and tested 4.3.3 / Pro 4.3.1 pairs; each new patch requires review and a Kit compatibility update instead of automatic acceptance within 4.3.x.
